=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play config/menu ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Configuration screen (pkg/screens/config),$
# proposed with no Figma frame, on a hardn.yml loaded by the$
# real loader (pkg/config). It only shows: no plan, no y/N, no$
# journal, no host read. Nothing on this machine changes or is$
# read.$
$
# Info: config/menu$
# Main menu 8: hardn.yml, Syslog Settings and NTP Settings. It$
# reads nothing.$
$
# Configuration ################################################$
$
   1) hardn.yml            View the file hardn reads$
   2) Syslog Settings      Send logs to a syslog server$
   3) NTP Settings         Keep the clock in sync$
   4) Kernel Settings      Harden network and kernel$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-4 or q]: q$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

